// it is a fact about the *layer*: `ffn_down_exps` is Q5_1 on 43 of the 48
// layers and Q8_0 on the other five, gate and up are Q4_K except on layer 2
// where they are Q5_K, and the shared expert is Q8_0 everywhere.
